# Shadow perimeter stack triggers

When working in matched paths, load skill `shadow-perimeter-personas` and suggest the auto-routed persona before dispatch.

| Signal | Suggest |
|--------|---------|
| Terraform/K8s/Docker/Render/Fly | `/shadow-architect` |
| auth/, middleware/, secrets | `/shadow-decryptor` |
| api/, routes/, openapi, graphql | `/shadow-enforcer` |
| shell scripts, Makefile | `/shadow-outlaw` |
| lockfiles, GitHub Actions | `/shadow-interceptor` |
| services/, workers/, webhooks | `/shadow-syndicate` |
| P0 / outage / hotfix in message | `/shadow-commander` or `/shadow-pilot` |

User may override with any `/shadow-*` command.
